<h1 id="privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> <%= legalEffectiveDate %></p>
<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>127 Group LLC</strong> (&quot;127&quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot;) collects, uses, shares and protects personal information when you visit 127group.io (including the member area at 127group.io/app), use our free tools (Founder Score, Day One Stack, Idea Test, First 25), use Eli's Playbook and our other AI tools, join a waitlist or membership, message us on social media, attend a Founder's Circle call or gathering, apply for or join the Founding Five, or otherwise interact with us (the &quot;Service&quot;).</p>
<h3 id="the-short-version">The short version</h3>
<ul class="bul">
<li>We collect what we need to run 127: your account details, your assessment answers, your progress and worksheets, what you type into our AI tools, and your billing status. Stripe handles your card; we never see your full card number.</li>
<li>What you type into Eli's Playbook and the Idea Test is sent to our AI provider to generate answers. We don't let it train its models on your content.</li>
<li>First 25 and HQ workflows that find businesses send the map services (Tracestrack and LocationIQ, for OpenStreetMap data) only the business type and city you search for. A First 25 list is deleted after 30 days (Sections 4 and 9).</li>
<li>HQ, for Builder members, can count your sales from Stripe or Shopify. For your weekly totals we keep only the totals, never the names or contact details in your sales, and a workflow you run keeps what it used for 180 days (Sections 7A and 7B). If you add HQ's AI link to Claude, ChatGPT or another AI app, that app's company handles what it reads under its own terms.</li>
<li>HQ's workflows and Pipeline keep what you add about your own clients and leads, only for you. We never contact them on our own, and a workflow's run is deleted 180 days after it ends (Section 7B).</li>
<li><strong>HQ's Brain, Ask 127, AI team, site chat and Studio:</strong> what you add and what they make stay private to you. Our AI provider gets only what each task needs and doesn't train on it, and nothing goes out from your accounts without your OK (Section 7C). Platforms you sign in to add their own rules (Section 7D).</li>
<li>We don't sell your personal information for money. If you say yes to ad cookies, Meta and TikTok help us measure our ads. If you say no, or your browser sends a Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track signal, those ad tools stay off.</li>
<li>We email you marketing only if you opt in, and you can unsubscribe anytime.</li>
<li>You can see, correct, export or delete your information, wherever you live. Delete your account anytime in Settings.</li>
<li>127 is for people 18 and older.</li>
</ul>
